# =============================================================================
# Soaratorium — .gitignore
# =============================================================================
# The original game is COPYRIGHTED. Neither it nor any derived extraction of it
# may ever be committed to this repository. Everything a contributor supplies
# locally lives under baserom/ and is ignored wholesale.
#
# Derived/analysis output (build products, Ghidra projects) is also ignored: it
# is reproducible from the (untracked) original binary.
# =============================================================================

# --- Original game data: NEVER commit -----------------------------------------
# Ignore the entire baserom tree, but keep the empty directory itself in Git.
baserom/*
!baserom/.gitkeep

# --- Ghidra projects & analysis artifacts -------------------------------------
*.gpr
*.rep/
*.ghidra/
ghidra_project*/
ghidra_projects/

# --- Build & derived output ---------------------------------------------------
build/
extracted/
out/
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.elf
*.map

# --- Python -------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
